FIX CLUT-ANIM SCATTERED LOCALS: MoveImageClut source rect passed as 4 separate u16 locals

CLUT_Animation @0x42cb6c builds a 4x u16 RECT block {src_x, src_clut, w=0x10, h=1}
on the stack and passes its ADDRESS to MoveImageClut, which reads it as memory:
`*param_1 >> 0x10` = src clut row, `(short)*param_1` = src x. The original asm
writes a contiguous 8-byte block at -0xc(%ebp):

  42cb82: 66 89 45 f4   mov %ax,-0xc(%ebp)   ; src_x    (frame+8)
  42cb9c: 66 89 45 f6   mov %ax,-0xa(%ebp)   ; src_clut (frame+10)
  42cba0: 66 89 5d f8   mov %bx,-0x8(%ebp)   ; w = 0x10
  42cba4: 66 89 4d fa   mov %cx,-0x6(%ebp)   ; h = 1
  42cbb8: 8d 45 f4      lea -0xc(%ebp),%eax  ; -> MoveImageClut param_1

Ghidra split the block into four independent locals (local_10/local_e/local_c/
local_a); gcc reordered them, so MoveImageClut saw {sx, 1, 0x10, src_clut}:
every animated CLUT (L6 neon signs: dollar/safe/casino/j/twist, case-6 block
of Draw_Other_Objects; measured srcblock 0000 0100 1000 0b00 = sy=1,h=11
instead of sy=11,h=1) was copied from CLUT 1 (a gray ramp) instead of its
real source rows. Ref vs our L6 attract diverged 253013/307200 px at cf4
("night city" vs washed-out gray ramps), "healing" only when the signs left
the camera view. Same scattered-locals class as the Setup_Sprite info blocks
(patch 655) and the DSBUFFERDESC blocks (patches 705/710).

--- a/dd2.c
+++ b/dd2.c
@@ -19409,16 +19409,17 @@
 void __cdecl CLUT_Animation(undefined4 param_1,int *param_2,int *param_3)
 
 {
-  undefined2 local_10;
-  undefined2 local_e;
-  undefined2 local_c;
-  undefined2 local_a;
+  /* asm 0x42cb82-0x42cbb8: one contiguous 8-byte RECT {x,y,w,h} at -0xc(%ebp),
+     passed by address to MoveImageClut -- must stay one block (scattered-locals
+     artifact: gcc reordered the four independent locals, so MoveImageClut read
+     src clut row = 1 instead of the real source row). */
+  undefined2 local_10 [4];
   
-  local_10 = *(undefined2 *)(param_2[*param_3] + 8);
-  local_e = *(undefined2 *)(param_2[*param_3] + 10);
-  local_c = 0x10;
-  local_a = 1;
-  MoveImageClut((int *)&local_10,*(int *)(*param_2 + 6) >> 0x10,*(int *)(*param_2 + 8) >> 0x10);
+  local_10[0] = *(undefined2 *)(param_2[*param_3] + 8);
+  local_10[1] = *(undefined2 *)(param_2[*param_3] + 10);
+  local_10[2] = 0x10;
+  local_10[3] = 1;
+  MoveImageClut((int *)local_10,*(int *)(*param_2 + 6) >> 0x10,*(int *)(*param_2 + 8) >> 0x10);
   return;
 }
 
